"legal_consent_version_format" = "I have read and agree to the following documents (version %@)";
"legal_privacy_body" = "Version: 2026-08-11\nOperator: Example Company, Ltd.\nContact: privacy@example.com\n\n1. Information We Process\nWe process account identifiers, contact details and avatars for registration, login, support and security; pet profiles and health records for user-requested records and reminders; foreground location for nearby places, navigation and service addresses; user-selected media, voice and chat content for submissions, profiles, AI recognition and transcription; order and wallet records for fulfillment and financial reconciliation; and reports, blocks, IP address, device/app data and necessary logs for safety and troubleshooting. Pet health information is not a clinical diagnosis.\n\n2. System Permissions\nCamera, photo library, microphone and foreground location permissions are requested only when you use the relevant feature. They may be withdrawn in iOS Settings. We do not continuously track background location.\n\n3. Processors and Sharing\nWe may use map, object storage, email/SMS, AI model, speech recognition, push and operations providers only as necessary to provide features, subject to contractual, access-control and encryption safeguards. We do not sell personal information to unrelated parties.\n\n4. Storage, Security and Retention\nData generated in mainland China operations is generally stored domestically. We use HTTPS, access control, key management, audit logs and backups. Data is deleted or anonymized when no longer needed, except records retained by law.\n\n5. Your Rights\nYou may access, correct, export or delete personal information, withdraw optional consent, request account deletion, complain or request an explanation.\n\n6. Children\nUsers under 14 should use the service with guardian consent and guidance.\n\n7. Updates and Contact\nMaterial changes will be prominently notified and renewed consent obtained where required. Contact privacy@example.com for privacy, reporting and data-rights requests.";
"legal_terms_body" = "Version: 2026-08-11\n1. PetFriendly provides pet-friendly place information, pet records, community features, AI assistance and technology services supporting offline services.\n2. Users must provide truthful, lawful and necessary information and protect their accounts and payment passwords.\n3. Places, reviews, images and chats must be lawful and must not infringe rights, harass, defraud, abuse animals or contain illegal material.\n4. The platform may review, reduce visibility, remove content, preserve evidence and restrict or suspend violating accounts. Users may report content and block users.\n5. Points may only be redeemed in the points store and cannot be purchased, transferred, withdrawn or used to pay for AI.\n6. Wallet balances are limited to service-order payments, compliant recharges and withdrawal requests. Recharges require payment-provider confirmation; withdrawals require identity and risk review.\n7. Offline services are performed by the actual provider. PetFriendly does not replace licensed veterinary diagnosis or treatment.\n8. AI output may be inaccurate and is informational only. Contact a licensed veterinarian in an emergency.\n9. Users may export data, request deletion and contact support. Legally required records may be retained with restricted access.\n10. The laws of the People's Republic of China apply, with disputes submitted to a competent court at the operator's location.";
"legal_community_body" = "Version: 2026-08-11\nThe community encourages truthful, supported and pet-friendly information. Illegal content, fraud, sexual or gambling content, hateful harassment, violent threats, animal abuse, doxxing, privacy or copyright infringement, fake places and malicious reviews are prohibited.\n\nAutomated checks run before publication and high-risk content is escalated for human review. Users may report content and immediately block users. Threats to people, child safety, animal abuse and fraud receive priority; ordinary reports begin review within 24 hours.\n\nEnforcement may include rejection, reduced visibility, removal, muting, account restrictions or termination. Appeals may be sent to support@example.com.";
"legal_ai_body" = "Version: 2026-08-11\n1. Emergency chat, image understanding, speech transcription and pet portraits use third-party AI models to process content you submit.\n2. AI output may be wrong, delayed or incomplete and is not veterinary diagnosis, a prescription or an emergency instruction. Seek a licensed veterinarian for high-risk symptoms.\n3. AI text and images carry visible labels; supported implicit labels are added in accordance with applicable rules and technical standards.\n4. Users must not maliciously remove, alter, forge or conceal AI labels and should disclose externally generated AI content.\n5. Inputs and outputs are subject to safety review, with necessary logs retained as required by law.\n6. AI features do not consume, recharge or redeem platform points.";
